                          "would make a same-person row count; post findings as a PR comment and file no hosted "
                          "verdict unless you are a distinct attested principal)")
# Local notes are not hosted rows: no permanence claim.
LOCAL_AUTHOR_ROW_HINT = (" (a note under the author's identity still refuses under --exception, and an "
