                         "only a fresh non-author session's review can)")
REVIEW_STANDARD_HINT = (" (the review standard is a fresh-session review by a non-author session, "
                        "and this gate cannot yet tell one from the author under one login: "
                        "post findings as a PR comment rather than file a hosted verdict as the author's "
                        "person, which is permanent and head-pinned (AGENTS.md \"Review\"). Routes: "
                        "workflow-issued rows (dispatch review-standards.yml and review-spec.yml; a first "
                        "pass, not a replacement for a real review on gate, security, schema and release "
                        "PRs, where two such rows satisfy other PRs), or --exception --advisory ... until EXCEPTION_ENDS in scripts/delivery-gate)")

